<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry Inc started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry Inc started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of DeVry Inc as a buy and set a $30 price target for the stock.</p>
<p>-- Sees &quot;hidden upside potential&quot; in turnaround of Canadian operations.</p>
<p>-- Sees &quot;longer-term outlook&quot; of 15-20 percent revenue growth and 20-25 percent earnings per share growth.</p>
<p>-- DeVry gained 1-1/4 to 24-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
